  "item_short_desc": "<p>Stay mission-ready with Rothco&rsquo;s AR 670-1 Coyote Brown T-Shirt. Engineered for performance, the undershirt is built for the demands experienced in the field. This coyote brown t-shirt is fully authorized for wear with Multicam and Scorpion OCP (Operational Camouflage Pattern) uniforms, making it a dependable base layer for military personnel.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "4864",
  "description": "<p>Stay mission-ready with Rothco&rsquo;s AR 670-1 Coyote Brown T-Shirt. Engineered for performance, the undershirt is built for the demands experienced in the field. This coyote brown t-shirt is fully authorized for wear with Multicam and Scorpion OCP (Operational Camouflage Pattern) uniforms, making it a dependable base layer for military personnel. Built for the Long Haul: Whether you're in the field or on duty, this crew neck shirt is made to handle tough conditions. The rugged cotton / polyester fabric blend stands up to daily wear, repeated machine washes, and demanding environments, while the fade-resistant Coyote Brown color keeps you looking sharp and uniform-ready. Solid Construction: The AR 670-1 Coyote Brown T-Shirt features reinforced seams at the collar, sleeves, and bottom hem to withstand heavy use and high-movement environments. Whether you're training, deployed, or on base, the solid construction ensures lasting performance that won&rsquo;t unravel. Built for Action: These base layer military uniform shirts are standard fit, giving you room and flexibility for various activities, especially around the arms. Their length should go past the waist, providing you with additional coverage while you&rsquo;re out and about. We&rsquo;ve Got You Covered: Pair your coyote brown tee with one of our Tactical BDU Cargo Pants or Vintage Paratrooper Cargo Shorts.</p>",
